# THE PLOUGH THROUGH THE PINES (Roster `breaks`, FightSim._break_through): a
# keeper is moved at the player's radius and drawn three tiles wide, so what its
# body walks into of the wood it declares goes down. The pine leans, comes over
# away from it, and lies; snow shudders off the crown; the tree it was is taken
# for good. Staged as a player does it: walk up to the snowfield's plough, hit
# it, and run for the trees; it comes after you through them.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/plough_wood.tour --seed=1 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 --held=axe_felling --config=unharmed
coast calm
place snowfield
near keeper
wait 0.6
await sentinel 12
walkto mob 20
tap swing
wait 0.6
tap swing
wait 0.6
shot 00-struck with mob:sentinel.snowfield
walkto prop:snow_pine,pine 5 run through
tap shoulder
await felled 25
wait 0.4
shot 01-it-comes-through-the-pines with shoulder,mob:sentinel.snowfield
wait 1.4
shot 02-the-pine-lies-where-it-fell with shoulder,mob:sentinel.snowfield
